message: "If you use this software, any part of it, or ideas and methods presented in this repository in your research or publications, please cite this repository."
title: "Quantum Lattice Boltzmann Method for 2D Fluid Flow"
authors:
  - family-names: Markazi
    given-names: Navid
version: 1.0.0
license: Apache-2.0
type: software
abstract: >-
  A simulator-based quantum-circuit prototype of the D2Q9
  Lattice Boltzmann Method for two-dimensional fluid flow,
  implemented using Python and PennyLane.
keywords:
  - Quantum computing
  - Lattice Boltzmann Method
  - Computational fluid dynamics
  - PennyLane
  - Quantum circuit simulation
